& [WhyNow] is the resident prerequisite passed
  + [cantord] is authenticated, bounded, refreshable, restartable, and exact-core equivalent
  + [MCP] is already a proven one-tool Codex surface
  + [gap] is MCP cannot yet use the shared generation

& [WhyThisShape] is least authority
  + [dual_mode] preserves embedded rollback
  + [pinned_client] prevents silent runtime retarget after startup
  + [startup_status] fails before MCP framing when the service is unavailable or unauthenticated
  + [unchanged_tool] adds no model-callable lifecycle or configuration power
  + [exact_nested_response] adds no adapter-local semantics

& [Alternatives] records rejection
  + [replace_embedded_mode] removes a proven rollback and is rejected
  + [model_callable_status_refresh_shutdown] expands authority and is rejected
  + [reread_config_each_call] permits silent endpoint and capability retarget and is rejected
  + [automatic_request_rebinding] hides staleness and is rejected
  + [new_tool_name] causes unnecessary tool-discovery and prompt drift and is rejected
